<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Pacific BBA lifts half yr net profit.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Pacific BBA lifts half yr net profit.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    17.43 vs  13.81</p>
<p>    Net				     12.60 vs   9.94</p>
<p>    Divident (cents)		     6.00 vs   5.00</p>
<p>NOTE: Pacific BBA Ltd manufactures automotive parts, plastic goods and products for the construction industry.  </p>
<p>    Sales				  262.15 vs 226.88</p>
<p>    Other income			  13.33 vs  11.61</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    9.6  vs   7.9</p>
<p>    Abnormal items			 nil  vs   nil</p>
<p>Dividend is fully franked</p>
