<p>Reg date Sep 19</p>
<p>    Tax					4.23 vs   2.67</p>
<p>    Interest				 5.72 vs   3.86</p>
<p>    Depreciation			  12.43 vs  10.67</p>
<p>    Minorities			     0.59 vs   1.20</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
